  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Vietnam - Ending Plastic Pollution Innovation Challenge (EPPIC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation of an open competition that will source innovative ideas from ASEAN countries for tackling local waste and plastics challenges, scale up and replicate these solutions, and deliver awareness-raising, capacity building and platforms for knowledge, cooperationd and networking. This will help reduce the rate of plastic pollution in coastal areas in four ASEAN target countries initially, and all ASEAN countries in the long term. The project is promoting women&apos;s empowerment through focusing on gender quality in the innovation competitions, which has traditionally seen a majority of male applicants.</narrative>
  </description>
